modifiers_err.wf:1:5: error: a declaration cannot be both `pub` and `private`
  |
1 | pub private fn a() { }
  |     ^^^^^^^
  = help: pick one visibility
modifiers_err.wf:2:1: error: `atomic` applies to functions, not variables
  |
2 | atomic var v: int = 1
  | ^^^^^^
modifiers_err.wf:3:7: error: duplicate modifier `final`
  |
3 | final final fn b() { }
  |       ^^^^^
  = help: remove one of them
modifiers_err.wf:4:1: error: `persistent` applies to variables, not functions
  |
4 | persistent fn c() { }
  | ^^^^^^^^^^
modifiers_err.wf:5:11: error: a declaration cannot be both `protected` and `pub`
  |
5 | protected pub var d: int = 0
  |           ^^^
  = help: pick one visibility
modifiers_err.wf:6:1: error: `override` applies to functions, not structs
  |
6 | override struct S { }
  | ^^^^^^^^
modifiers_err.wf:7:5: error: `inherit` takes no modifiers
  |
7 | pub inherit /x
  |     ^^^^^^^
modifiers_err.wf:9:7: error: `->` is not a call operator in Weft
  |
9 |     ob->tell("x")
  |       ^^
  = help: call functions on objects with `.`: `ob.fn()`
modifiers_err.wf:10:15: error: unexpected `|` in an expression
   |
10 |     let t = a | b
   |               ^
   = help: Weft uses `or` for logical disjunction; `|` separates `match` patterns
modifiers_err.wf:11:15: error: unexpected `||`
   |
11 |     let u = a || b
   |               ^^
   = help: Weft uses `or` for logical disjunction
modifiers_err.wf:12:13: error: unexpected `!`
   |
12 |     let v = !a && b
   |             ^
   = help: Weft uses `not` for logical negation
modifiers_err.wf:12:16: error: unexpected `&&`
   |
12 |     let v = !a && b
   |                ^^
   = help: Weft uses `and` for logical conjunction
modifiers_err.wf:13:5: error: preprocessor directives are not part of Weft
   |
13 |     #include "x"
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: use `import` for shared declarations and `const` for constants
modifiers_err.wf:16:1: error: `lightweight` must come before any declarations
   |
